view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":98,"digest":"sha256:2353d28b6062e727a2c2080ab9fff3f9b35aca56a996e2bfc6dac422e1c54f93","download_count":39,"created_at":"2026-10-15T22:27:13Z","updated_at":"2026-10-15T22:27:13Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/anza-xyz/agave/releases/download/v4.3.2/solana-release-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.yml"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anza-xyz/agave/tarball/v4.3.2","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anza-xyz/agave/zipball/v4.3.2","body":"This a stable release suitable for Testnet, Devnet and Mainnet Beta.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/anza-xyz/agave/blob/v4.3/CHANGELOG.md\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* v4.3: ci: ignore RUSTSEC-2026-0292 (imbl-sized-chunks) in cargo audit by @nbelenkov in https://github.com/anza-xyz/agave/pull/15572\r\n* v4.3: pin cargo-build-sbf and spl-token-cli to the latest release by @levsha in https://github.com/anza-xyz/agave/pull/15551\r\n* v4.3: ci: disallow imbl::Vector and RUSTSEC-2026-0292 chunk methods by @nbelenkov in https://github.com/anza-xyz/agave/pull/15587\r\n* v4.3: ledger-tool: Bump max supported transaction version (backport of #14826) by @mergify[bot] in https://github.com/anza-xyz/agave/pull/15593\r\n* v4.3: ci: add bypass user list to the buildkite triggering pipeline (backport of #15682) by @mergify[bot] in https://github.com/anza-xyz/agave/pull/15791\r\n* v4.3: ci: use github app token to create version bump PRs (backport of #15733) by @mergify[bot] in https://github.com/anza-xyz/agave/pull/15734\r\n* v4.3: ci: url encode username in bulidkite triggering piepline (backport of #15684) by @mergify[bot] in https://github.com/anza-xyz/agave/pull/15789\r\n* v4.3: bigtable: don't upload past the blockstore's max root (backport of #15804) by @mergify[bot] in https://github.com/anza-xyz/agave/pull/15837\r\n* v4.3: fix: use Alpenglow slot timing for transaction buffering (backport of #15589) by @mergify[bot] in https://github.com/anza-xyz/agave/pull/15657\r\n* v4.3: fix: make Alpenglow slot timing available on Windows (backport of #15886) by @mergify[bot] in https://github.com/anza-xyz/agave/pull/15890\r\n* v4.3: local-cluster: fix flaky alpenglow_basic_equivocation (backport of #14778) by @mergify[bot] in https://github.com/anza-xyz/agave/pull/15924\r\n* v4.3: vendor quinn-proto 0.11.15 and quinn 0.11.11 by @gregcusack in https://github.com/anza-xyz/agave/pull/15953\r\n* v4.3: ci: retry create-stake-account cmd in localnet test (backport of #14505) by @mergify[bot] in https://github.com/anza-xyz/agave/pull/15936\r\n* Bump version to 4.3.1 by @agave-version-bumper[bot] in https://github.com/anza-xyz/agave/pull/15984\r\n* v4.3: ignore rustls RUSTSECs that do not impact Agave by @akhi3030 in https://github.com/anza-xyz/agave/pull/16055\r\n* v4.3: vendor quinn for rustsec20260339 by @gregcusack in https://github.com/anza-xyz/agave/pull/16060\r\n* v4.3: VoteStateHandler: uses wincode for serialization (backport of #15972) by @mergify[bot] in https://github.com/anza-xyz/agave/pull/16044\r\n* v4.3: Improves performance of [de]serializing `VoteStateVersions` (backport of #15986) by @mergify[bot] in https://github.com/anza-xyz/agave/pull/16026\r\n* v4.3: bls-cert-verify: specify an optional thread pool (backport of #16059) by @mergify[bot] in https://github.com/anza-xyz/agave/pull/16085\r\n* v4.3: runtime: narrow check_and_store() to AccountSharedData (backport of #15398) by @mergify[bot] in https://github.com/anza-xyz/agave/pull/16043\r\n* v4.3: stakes cache: check StakeStateV2 tag in check_and_store() (backport of #16050) by @mergify[bot] in https://github.com/anza-xyz/agave/pull/16072\r\n* v4.3: vote_reward.rs: avoids calloc when creating new AccountSharedData (backport of #16101) by @mergify[bot] in https://github.com/anza-xyz/agave/pull/16103\r\n* Bump version to 4.3.2 by @agave-version-bumper[bot] in https://github.com/anza-xyz/agave/pull/16106\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/anza-xyz/agave/compare/v4.3.0...v4.3.2","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anza-xyz/agave/releases/414328464/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":5}